# API standards

- Paths and methods must match `specs/<TICKET>/api-contract.md` for the active work item.
- Use consistent error body: code, message, optional field errors (document in contract).
- Pagination/filter/query params as specified in contract; no silent renames.
- Version breaking changes only with spec revision + `spec-diff.md` entry.
- OpenAPI/Swagger optional; `api-contract.md` is source of truth during spec-driven work.

See `docs/spec-pipeline/steering/` and the active work item `api-contract.md`.
